  Slug: hammered-by-fate
  DisplayName: Hammered by Fate
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: "Your life has been difficult, in no small part due to the influence
    of all things fiendish in your past. You might be a tiefling whose heritage has
    resulted in you being shunned or ostracized by society, or you could be any ancestry
    who grew up in a land where fiendish influence lingers\u2014such as devil-haunted
    Cheliax or the realm of Sarkoris Scar, where the influence of the Worldwound
    and its demonic invaders yet linger. Perhaps you carry an old scar or wound from
    a frightening encounter with a demon, have a fiend-related element as part of
    your class (such as a sorcerer bloodline or a fiendish patron whom you worship),
    or endured a long-term affliction from a fiendish source that only recently has
    been alleviated. Whatever the case, fate has thrown horror and terror at you
    at every turn, and that's taught you to always be ready for whatever those fiends
    might have in store for you next. This background is associated with the suit
    of Hammers. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Strength , and one is
    a free attribute boost. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Hefty
    Hauler] skill feat and are trained in one of the following Lore skills, as fits
    your history: Daemon Lore, Demon Lore, or Devil Lore. You also gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Harrow
    the Fiend] free action."
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Stolen Fate Player's Guide
